{"game": "risk-of-rain-2013", "language": "english", "appid": 248820, "month": "2020-10", "window": 1, "start_date": 1601510400, "end_date": 1602115199, "month_true_total": 52, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 09:18:22 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "77145476", "author": {"steamid": "76561198042403226", "personaname": "Harmonious Gale N∑", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198042403226/", "num_games_owned": 970, "num_reviews": 45, "playtime_forever": 6605, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2686, "last_played": 1784252282, "avatar": "e770a6b609e45a9b9003c63ed1f72663f1991426"}, "language": "english", "review": "The OG Risk of Rain experience. Running away from Magma Worms, or even avoiding a whole trail of Lemurians biting you, this is the brutal experience of being a survivor in Risk of Rain. Of course you start off as the reliable Commando, and each time you play, you learn from it and if able to, try another character that you may have just unlocked on your last run. And once that cycle is over, you try and try again until you beat the game.\n\nIs the fun over? Nah, you see, there are also hidden modifiers, or artifacts, in the game that can make it either easier or harder. The choice is yours, survivor.\n\nP.S. Good luck drowning 20 Whorls.", "timestamp_created": 1602017531, "timestamp_updated": 1602017531, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "77143305", "author": {"steamid": "76561198255615432", "personaname": "JeffryThePig", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198255615432/", "num_games_owned": 183, "num_reviews": 40, "playtime_forever": 4128, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 435, "last_played": 1625507728, "avatar": "57d23c32f70c3dad1397b91abdca9819ed2462d4"}, "language": "english", "review": "I played the second game before this and expected it to be very similar, so I was not expecting much. However, this game has so much more to offer! The aiming system is completely different than I thought, there are so many different items, and the characters are very diverse! I highly recommend trying this game out before the second game!", "timestamp_created": 1602014272, "timestamp_updated": 1602014272, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "77109632", "author": {"steamid": "76561198268027781", "personaname": "Huntress", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198268027781/", "num_games_owned": 274, "num_reviews": 89, "playtime_forever": 1614, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1566, "last_played": 1602364600, "avatar": "a2318ac4c22a9c4ee2044b36bbb674903b032b34"}, "language": "english", "review": "After probably thousands of hours played (torrents and friend's steam accounts) yeah I'd say I recommend it.", "timestamp_created": 1601957156, "timestamp_updated": 1601957156, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "77098772", "author": {"steamid": "76561198371669629", "personaname": "e991e", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/e991e/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_